<title>JAPAN: Jonathan's plans share split.</title>
<headline>Jonathan's plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jonathan's Co Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on February 20,1997, for shareholders as of December 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
